error SEM3168 testdata/golden/crossing/block02/invalid/on_negative_array_of_handles_capture.sg:10:23 `Array<Channel<int>>` cannot cross a shard boundary: its element `Channel<int>` may not move between shards, and an array crosses only when every element it holds may. Hold elements that travel -- a fixed-width value, a `string`, or a type you have marked `@shard_movable` -- or leave the array on this shard and cross what you need out of it
